:: RobinTemple Transformation
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to 'temple'>><<temple_effects>><<effects>><<npc Robin>><<person1>>
<<if $RobinTemple.transformation_day isnot Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.transformation_day to Time.days>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.transformation_count to 0>>
<</if>>
<<if $RobinTemple.transformation_count lt 3 and C.npc.Robin.love gte 10
  and maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').member and maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').available
  and maplebirch.get('RobinTemple').forms.includes($RobinTemple.transformation_kind)>>
  <<set $RobinTemple.transformation_count += 1>>
  <<switch $RobinTemple.transformation_kind>>
    <<case 'fox'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Robin rests <<his>> head on your tail. "I was only going to close my eyes for a moment," <<he>> says. An initiate clears <<his>> throat, and Robin sits up at once.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾把头枕在你的尾巴上。“我只是想闭一会儿眼，”<<he>>说。一名见习教徒清了清嗓子，罗宾立刻坐直。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'wolf'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You nudge Robin gently. <<He>> notices your ears and scratches behind one, then remembers where you are and pulls <<his>> hand back with a smile.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你轻轻碰了碰罗宾。<<He>>留意到你的耳朵，挠了挠耳根，随后想起自己身在何处，笑着收回手。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'cat'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You settle close to Robin. <<He>> strokes your hair as <<he>> finishes a line of prayer. A quiet purr makes <<him>> lose <<his>> place.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你挨着罗宾坐下。<<He>>一边念完那句祷词，一边轻抚你的头发。你轻轻呼噜一声，<<he>>便忘了念到哪里。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'bird'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Your song draws a few listeners. Robin waits until you finish before joining their applause. "You should sing here again," <<he>> says.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你的歌声引来几名听众。罗宾等你唱完，也跟着鼓掌。“下次还来唱吧，”<<he>>说。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'cow'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You touch Robin’s shoulder with your head. <<He>> reaches toward your horn, then pauses. "Does it hurt if I touch it?" <<he>> asks before moving closer.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你用头轻碰罗宾的肩。<<He>>伸手想摸你的角，又停住了。“碰它会疼吗？”<<he>>问过才靠近。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'horse'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Robin fetches a comb from beside <<his>> bunk. "Tell me if I pull," <<he>> says. <<He>> works from the ends of your tail upward, easing apart the tangles caught by your clothes. When someone passes the doorway, <<he>> lowers <<his>> voice. "There. Better?"
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾从床铺旁取来一把梳子。“扯疼了就告诉我，”<<he>>说。<<He>>从尾巴末端一点点往上梳，把衣服缠乱的毛发慢慢理开。有人从门前经过时，<<he>>放低了声音。“好了。舒服些了吗？”
      <</language>>
    <<case 'fish'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          Robin leans closer to look at your fins, careful not to touch them. "Do they move when you hear something?" <<he>> whispers. A bell rings from the hall, and the movement answers for you. <<He>> smiles, then makes room for you on the bench.
        <<option 'CN'>>
          罗宾凑近看你的耳鳍，小心地没有伸手碰。“听见声音时，它们也会动吗？”<<he>>轻声问。大厅里响起钟声，耳鳍的动作替你作了回答。<<He>>笑起来，随后在长椅上给你腾出位置。
      <</language>>
    <<case 'raven'>>
      <<language>>
        <<option 'EN'>>
          You turn on the bench and ease one black wing towards Robin. A few feathers near your back stick out where your clothes have caught them. "Here?" <<he>> asks, touching one lightly. You nod, and <<he>> smooths it into place, pausing whenever your wing twitches. "You can't reach these yourself, can you?" <<He>> moves aside so you can fold your wing again. "Come and find me if it happens again."
        <<option 'CN'>>
          你在长椅上转过身，把一侧黑色羽翼缓缓伸向罗宾。靠近背部的几根羽毛被衣服挤乱，翘了起来。“这里吗？”<<he>>轻轻碰了一根，问道。你点点头，<<he>>便顺着羽毛理过去，每当你的翅膀轻颤，就停一停。“这几根，你自己够不到吧？”<<He>>往旁边挪了挪，让你收起翅膀。“以后再弄乱，就来找我。”
      <</language>>
  <</switch>>
  <<npcincr Robin love 2>>
  <<switch $RobinTemple.transformation_kind>>
    <<case 'fox' 'cow'>><<trauma -2>><<glove>><<ltrauma>><br><br>
    <<case 'wolf' 'horse' 'fish' 'raven'>><<stress -2>><<glove>><<lstress>><br><br>
    <<case 'cat'>><<tiredness -2>><<glove>><<ltiredness>><br><br>
    <<case 'bird'>><<tiredness -1>><<glove>><<ltiredness>><<if maplebirch.get('TempleChoir')>><<singingskill 3>><<gsingingskill>><</if>><br><br>
  <</switch>>
<<else>>
  <<language>>
    <<option 'EN'>>
      You have already finished this interaction, or it is not available now.
    <<option 'CN'>>
      这次互动已经结束，或是现在无法进行。
  <</language>><br><br>
<</if>>
<!-- 消耗这次从长椅选择的互动，重访结果页不会重复结算。 -->
<<set $RobinTemple.transformation_kind to ''>>
<<templeicon 'altar'>><<lanLink '回到长椅' 'RobinTemple Prayer'>><</lanLink>><br>
